# D3-PO-007: The same repeat-unit formula does not mean the same enzyme substrate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 37C
add v1 starch 0.2g
add v1 amylase 0.01g
add v2 water 50mL @ 37C
add v2 cellulose 0.2g
add v2 amylase 0.01g
wait 30min
particles v1
particles v2
add v1 KI 0.0001mol
add v2 KI 0.0001mol
add v1 I2 0.00002mol
add v2 I2 0.00002mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
